<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"That's strange... I'm sure it was right here..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Sakura<STYLE ID="1">, the falsificaso's ready. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> thirteenth-year memorial service batch still had some left."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... Thank you for your trouble."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
"It's strange. I can't find the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> and the tripod for heating the falsificaso."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haha, is there anybody in this settlement odd enough to steal those?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro</STYLE>, it's no laughing matter. Without them we can't use the falsificaso at the funeral. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-chan's</STYLE> first-anniversary memorial is tomorrow!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, right... Sorry, sorry."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you there!? I could use a man's help!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Shirozaki-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> calling. I'll head over for a bit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay, I'll keep looking from here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Got it. Then I'll leave the rest to you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Surely not, but..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"The door's open...?
{PAUSE ""}
　This place has been off limits all this time..."<PG>
"If someone's in here, I'll have to tell them to come out. 
{PAUSE ""}
What could be past this point...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"The lamp's lit...!?
{PAUSE ""}
　The lamp oil is still fresh, too. Someone's been in here. 
{PAUSE ""}
Maybe the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> and the tripod are in here...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Hey, is someone there? This place is off limits."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\0空洞静止.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"What is this stone? Set down here where it doesn't belong..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\1空洞動く1人.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"It's heavy, but I can move it. Maybe they're hidden behind it?
{PAUSE ""}
　Um... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, this nata should do."<PG>
"Hup!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\3動かす.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
